#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Uru ni urwego rw'ijwi ry'ikiganiro kuri buri sohoka. Urwego rukoreshwa mu "
"buryo bwikora iyo telefone ihuye na buri gihe isohoka rihindutse mu gihe "
"cy'ikiganiro, kandi impinduka z'akanyereza zumvikana ako kanya. Hardware "
"ikoresha inzego mu ntambwe nini, kandi agasipikari k'ugutwi ntikigera "
"gacecekera burundu. Urwego rwa Bluetooth rubikwa ku bw'inkunga y'icyerekezo "
"izaza."

